msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "莉娅"
msgstr "Lia"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "他"
msgstr "He"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "裂隙"
msgstr "Rift"

msgid "这里只有现在，所以你不必奔逃了"
msgstr "Only the present exists here. You no longer need to run."

msgid "可能性存在时，金色的结构会凝固"
msgstr "While a possibility exists, golden structures become solid."

msgid "撞碎可能性，冲刺会回到你身上"
msgstr "Shatter a possibility, and your dash returns to you."

msgid "三条路，三枚装置。全部点亮，前方出口就会打开"
msgstr "Three paths. Three devices. Light them all, and the exit ahead will open."

msgid "只剩三十分钟。完成交接，你就能离开"
msgstr "Only thirty minutes remain. Complete the handoff, and you can leave."

msgid "如果你还有问题，可以来问我"
msgstr "If you still have questions, ask me."

msgid "...你想知道什么？"
msgstr "...What do you want to know?"

msgid "这里是哪里？"
msgstr "Where is this?"

msgid "...时间的裂隙，过去现在未来交错的试炼之地"
msgstr "...A rift in time. A proving ground where past, present, and future intersect."

msgid "恐惧过去，失去未来之人将会来到这里"
msgstr "Those who fear the past and lose their future come here."

msgid "在倒计时结束之前离去，否则就只能永远困在这里"
msgstr "Leave before the countdown ends, or remain trapped here forever."

msgid "那些红色幻影和金色幻影是什么？"
msgstr "What are the red and golden echoes?"

msgid "...红色是你延迟的过去，金色是你记录下的未来可能性"
msgstr "...Red is your delayed past. Gold is a future possibility you recorded."

msgid "在这里，过去能影响现在和未来，现在就只能影响未来"
msgstr "Here, the past can affect the present and future. The present can only affect the future."

msgid "我想要离开需要做什么？"
msgstr "What do I need to do to leave?"

msgid "...想要离开吗？这是三条试炼之路"
msgstr "...You want to leave? There are three paths of trial."

msgid "激活每条路上的装置，就能解开前方出口"
msgstr "Activate the device on each path, and the exit ahead will open."

msgid "你是谁？"
msgstr "Who are you?"

msgid "...我是试炼的失败者"
msgstr "...I failed the trial."

msgid "只剩下现在，忘记了过去也没有未来"
msgstr "Only my present remains. I forgot my past and have no future."

msgid "成为了给未来的试炼者提供消息的存在"
msgstr "I became something that leaves guidance for future challengers."

msgid "希望你能通过试炼[]然后替代我[]。这样我就能离开"
msgstr "I hope you pass the trial[]and take my place[]so I can leave."

msgid "你一开始说的话是什么意思？"
msgstr "What did you mean at the beginning?"

msgid "...未来体在被你撞碎后可以成为你的"
msgstr "...A Future becomes yours after you shatter it."

msgid "那些碎片是什么？"
msgstr "What are those shards?"

msgid "...不知道。它们不属于试炼"
msgstr "...I don't know. They are not part of the trial."

msgid "你没必要收集那些。在倒计时前通过试炼"
msgstr "You do not need them. Finish the trial before the countdown ends."

msgid "那才是离开的正确方式"
msgstr "That is the proper way to leave."

msgid "我留下关掉它。你先走。"
msgstr "I'll stay and shut it down. You go first."

msgid "艾米莉娅——"
msgstr "Emilia-"

msgid "别叫全名。跑吧。我会跟上你。"
msgstr "Don't use my full name. Run. I'll catch up with you."

msgid "我不会一个人走。我不会把莉娅留在这里。"
msgstr "I won't leave alone. I won't leave Lia here."

msgid "不是你……"
msgstr "It wasn't you..."

msgid "RUN——"
msgstr "RUN-"

msgid "……"
msgstr "..."

msgid "我跑了。"
msgstr "I ran."

msgid "我害死了莉娅。"
msgstr "I got Lia killed."

msgid "你希望我拿走什么？"
msgstr "What do you want me to take?"

msgid "过去。未来。她会恨我的那一部分。"
msgstr "My past. My future. The part of me she would hate."

msgid "我只会照见你的愿望。"
msgstr "I only reflect the wish you bring me."

msgid "全部拿走。"
msgstr "Take all of it."

msgid "……那些碎片不属于试炼。别被它们拖住。"
msgstr "...Those shards are not part of the trial. Do not let them slow you down."

msgid "……四段都在你身上？出口在前面。别再回头。"
msgstr "...You have all four? The exit is ahead. Do not turn back."

msgid "……不会发生什么。我只是等得太久了。"
msgstr "...Nothing will happen. I have simply waited too long."

msgid "不是你把我留下。是我选择留下。RUN. 我爱你。我会追上你。"
msgstr "You did not leave me behind. I chose to stay. RUN. I love you. I will catch up with you."

msgid "你亲手记录的未来，正沿着裂隙回到那一声 RUN。"
msgstr "The future you recorded is traveling back through the rift to that cry of RUN."

msgid "莉娅。"
msgstr "Lia."

msgid "这次，一起跑。"
msgstr "This time, we run together."

msgid "跑吧。"
msgstr "Run."

